<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    Hindi strings.

    Wording follows the Bankmitra2 app that the same field staff already use, so a
    supervisor moving between the two apps reads the same word for the same thing:
    विज़िट, वसूली, बकाया, ऋणी, टिप्पणियाँ.

    Codes that appear on the borrower's paperwork stay in Latin script — KRM OTS,
    CKCC OD-2, BCBF, NPA, PTP, GPS — because those are what is printed on the forms
    and spreadsheets in front of them.

    app_name is deliberately absent: the launcher icon keeps one name in both
    languages, which is what people point at when they say "open LRMS".
-->
